.No \&( Ns Ql "compile-multi"
python key + action).
.It
\fBDecide (design calls):\fP Finding 3 (drop the bidi knob), Finding 11
.No \&( Ns Ql "global-jinx-mode"
vs status quo), Finding 12
.No \&( Ns Ql "appt" Ns No "/diary"
— feature or documented non-goal), Finding 13 (GC constant + depth guard).
.El
